message: "If you use this software or benchmark, please cite the paper below."
title: "RAF: Rubric Auto-generation Framework for Auditable Evaluation of Long-Horizon LLM Agents"
abstract: "RAF generates and iteratively refines case-level AND-OR rubric trees for evaluating long-horizon LLM agents. The repository also releases ClawBench, a benchmark of 121 personal-assistant tasks with verified rubrics."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The RAF Authors"
